# The press that opens a menu or a pop-up's list, and its release (design 10.6, メニューと一覧を
# 開いた押下の離し), for tools/ui_run.py and tools/x64/ui_run64.py. The window TADjsについて is in
# front at the start, its work area under 600,420; its menu opens with 閉じる under the pointer.
# - the second button pressed and let go 50 ms later, and 800 ms later without moving: the menu
#   stays open both times (shots mc_quick, mc_slow), and Esc puts it away;
# - the first button pressed and let go while the second is held, as a pointer out of step
#   reports a button nobody pressed (the TrackPoint of the ThinkPad X1 Yoga): not the menu's,
#   and 閉じる is not chosen -- the window stays in front;
# - システム環境設定's pop-up 表示の倍率 (at 658,455; 150% a row of 20 two rows down, 設定 at
#   706,554, as tools/tests/ui_scale.steps works them) pressed and let go 800 ms later without
#   moving: its list stays open, and a click on 150% in it chooses it. Enter keeps the scale.
wait 1000
move 600 420
wait 300
down 1
wait 50
up 1
wait 1000
shot mc_quick
key 29
wait 800
move 600 420
down 1
wait 800
up 1
wait 1000
shot mc_slow
key 29
wait 800
move 600 420
down 1
wait 30
down 0
wait 30
up 0
wait 30
up 1
expect desktop: menu: button 0 pressed while the menu's is held: not taken
wait 1000
key 29
wait 800
front mc TADjsについて
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 206 181
wait 300
click 706 184
expect sysenv: screen scale 100%, 3 scales
wait 500
move 658 455
down 0
wait 800
up 0
wait 800
shot mc_list
click 658 495
wait 300
click 706 554
expect wm: drawn at 150% (was 100%)
wait 1500
key 28
expect drawn at 150%, kept
wait 1000
absent !OACV!
